    <bpmn:process id="W_W4505" name="W4505. CSR Strategy, Pillars &amp; Social-License Framework" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Corporate strategy (VS-33); board review; community/stakeholder signal
Frequency: Annual + on strategy change
Volume: One enterprise CSR strategy across 200 store communities
Owner: Foundation Executive Director / Sustainability/ESG Manager
Participants: Strategy (VS-33), ESG (VS-25), Marketing (VS-14.3), Govt Affairs (VS-104), Board (VS-36)
Source: workflow W4505 — CSR Strategy, Pillars &amp; Social-License Framework</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4505_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4505_Lane1" name="Foundation ED">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4505_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4505_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4505_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4505_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4505_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4505_Start3" name="Corporate strategy (VS-33); board review; community/stakeholder signal">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4505_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4505_Task4" name="Foundation ED/Sustainability Lead set the CSR strategy and pillars (e.g…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Foundation ED/Sustainability Lead set the CSR strategy and pillars (e.g., shelter/housing, livelihood, education, disaster resilience, environment), aligned to BuildRight&#x27;s &quot;Home Building Partner&quot; purpose and corporate strategy (VS-33)
Responsible (R): Foundation ED / Sustainability Lead
Accountable (A): CEO / Board CSR Committee
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4505_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4505_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4505_Task5" name="Foundation ED/Stakeholders map social-license priorities per region/community…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Foundation ED/Stakeholders map social-license priorities per region/community (Mindanao HQ, Visayas, Luzon) using community/stakeholder input (links to VS-104/VS-44), and sequence the portfolio
Responsible (R): Foundation ED / Stakeholders
Accountable (A): CEO / Board CSR Committee
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4505_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4505_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4505_Task6" name="Foundation ED/Sustainability Lead document the strategy, obtain board…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Foundation ED/Sustainability Lead document the strategy, obtain board endorsement (VS-36), and cascade to program design (W4514), budget (W4508), and reporting (W4525)
Responsible (R): Foundation ED / Sustainability Lead
Accountable (A): CEO / Board CSR Committee
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4505_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4505_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4505_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4505_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4505_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-165 (ensure CSR / foundation governance &amp; safeguarding.) | - CTL-686: CSR strategy board-endorsed (VS-36); aligned to corporate purpose (VS-33); community-priority-informed
Owner: Foundation Executive Director / Sustainability/ESG Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
