    <bpmn:process id="W_W4506" name="W4506. Foundation Legal Setup, SEC Registration &amp; BIR Qualified-Donee Status" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Foundation formation; regulatory change; BIR re-accreditation
Frequency: Per lifecycle (formation) + periodic renewal
Volume: One BuildRight Foundation legal entity + donee status
Owner: Legal (VS-100.3) / Foundation ED / Tax (VS-79)
Participants: Compliance (VS-22), Tax (VS-79), Finance (VS-17), Governance (VS-36)
Source: workflow W4506 — Foundation Legal Setup, SEC Registration &amp; BIR Qualified-Donee Status</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4506_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4506_Lane1" name="Legal">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4506_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4506_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4506_Lane2" name="Tax">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4506_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4506_Lane3" name="Compliance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4506_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4506_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4506_Start5" name="Foundation formation; regulatory change; BIR re-accreditation">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4506_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4506_Task6" name="Legal/Foundation ED register the Foundation with SEC (Articles, Bylaws, purpose…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Legal/Foundation ED register the Foundation with SEC (Articles, Bylaws, purpose clause), secure LGU/permits, and establish the legal/operating framework distinct from operating entities (profile §2)
Responsible (R): Legal / Foundation ED
Accountable (A): VP Legal / Board
Duration: Per formation</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4506_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4506_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4506_Task7" name="Tax/Legal secure and maintain BIR qualified-donee status (donations deductible…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Tax/Legal secure and maintain BIR qualified-donee status (donations deductible, tax-deductible receipts) and the PCNC accreditation (W4507), with annual revalidation
Responsible (R): Tax / Legal / Foundation ED
Accountable (A): CFO / VP Legal
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4506_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4506_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4506_Task8" name="Compliance/Legal maintain the regulatory calendar (SEC filings, BIR donee…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Compliance/Legal maintain the regulatory calendar (SEC filings, BIR donee re-accreditation, PCNC renewal, LGU permits) and manage audit response (VS-22/VS-21)
Responsible (R): Compliance / Legal
Accountable (A): VP Legal
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4506_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4506_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4506_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4506_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4506_Annotation10">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-165 (ensure CSR / foundation governance &amp; safeguarding.) | - CTL-686: Foundation SEC-registered &amp; purpose-bounded; BIR donee status maintained; PCNC accredited (W4507)
Owner: Legal (VS-100.3) / Foundation ED / Tax (VS-79)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
