        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-165 (ensure CSR / foundation governance &amp; safeguarding.) | - CTL-686: Foundation board independent w/ COI policy; separately audited (VS-21); PCNC accredited
Owner: Foundation Board / Corporate Secretary (VS-36)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
