    <bpmn:process id="W_W4508" name="W4508. CSR Budgeting, Endowment &amp; Fund Allocation Governance" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual budget (VS-33/VS-17.4); program approval; donation inflow
Frequency: Annual + per program/donation
Volume: CSR spend ~0.5–2% of net profit (PHP ~0.02B–0.1B/yr on a ~PHP 4–5B net-profit base) + endowment + donations
Owner: Foundation ED / Finance (VS-17.4) / Sustainability/ESG Manager
Participants: Strategy (VS-33), Treasury (VS-18), Programs, Board Finance Committee
Source: workflow W4508 — CSR Budgeting, Endowment &amp; Fund Allocation Governance</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4508_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4508_Lane1" name="Foundation ED">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4508_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4508_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4508_Lane2" name="Board Finance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4508_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4508_Lane3" name="Finance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4508_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4508_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4508_Start5" name="Annual budget (VS-33/VS-17.4); program approval; donation inflow">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4508_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4508_Task6" name="Foundation ED/Finance build the annual CSR budget (corporate allocation +…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Foundation ED/Finance build the annual CSR budget (corporate allocation + Foundation endowment draw + donations), aligned to the strategy pillars (W4505) and corporate budget (VS-33/VS-17.4)
