        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-165 (ensure CSR / foundation governance &amp; safeguarding.) | - CTL-686: CSR risks in ERM (VS-21.2); safeguarding/PSEA policy; violations to speak-up (VS-119); field-ops HSE (VS-24)
Owner: Risk (VS-21.2) / Foundation ED / Compliance (VS-22)</bpmn:text>
