      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: System need; impact-measurement (W4521); integration
Frequency: Per lifecycle + continuous
Volume: One CSR/Foundation data &amp; systems landscape
Owner: IT (VS-27) / Data (VS-28) / Foundation ED / EA (VS-113)
Participants: Finance (VS-17), Analytics (VS-28), Security (VS-27.3), Privacy (VS-91)
Source: workflow W4512 — CSR Data, Systems &amp; Integration Architecture</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4512_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4512_Lane1" name="IT">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4512_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
