        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4512_Lane3" name="Security">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4512_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4512_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4512_Start5" name="System need; impact-measurement (W4521); integration">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4512_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4512_Task6" name="IT/EA/Foundation ED design the CSR/Foundation systems landscape…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: IT/EA/Foundation ED design the CSR/Foundation systems landscape (grants/partnership mgmt, volunteer platform, beneficiary/impact data, donations), per EA standards (VS-113)
Responsible (R): IT / EA / Foundation ED
Accountable (A): CIO / Foundation ED
Duration: Per lifecycle</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4512_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4512_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4512_Task7" name="Data/Foundation ED build the impact-measurement data model (beneficiaries…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Data/Foundation ED build the impact-measurement data model (beneficiaries, outcomes, indicators) on the platform (VS-28), integrated to finance (W4508 fund-use) and partner data
Responsible (R): Data / Foundation ED
Accountable (A): CIO / Foundation ED
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4512_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4512_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4512_Task8" name="Security/Privacy ensure beneficiary/donor data is secured (VS-27.3) and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Security/Privacy ensure beneficiary/donor data is secured (VS-27.3) and privacy-respecting (VS-91 — beneficiary PII), with retention (VS-88)
Responsible (R): Security / Privacy / IT
Accountable (A): CIO / DPO
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4512_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4512_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4512_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4512_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4512_Annotation10">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-686 (ensure controlled execution — CSR Strategy, Governance &amp; Foundation Operations (PA-152.1).) | - CTL-686: CSR systems EA-governed (VS-113); impact data unified; beneficiary data secured/privacy-respecting (VS-91/VS-27.3)
Owner: IT (VS-27) / Data (VS-28) / Foundation ED / EA (VS-113)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
